# Keep implementations simple

- Prefer the smallest change that solves the problem.
- Do not add new layers, libraries, or abstractions “for later” unless the user asked.
- Avoid clever code, huge functions, and copy-paste across many files when one small edit works.
- Match existing project patterns (`AppContainer`, Compose screens, Room repositories).
- If two options exist, choose the one that is easier to read and debug.
